---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config.js';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE.name}`} description="What Confident Masculinity is, and what we write about.">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>Dating, mindset, presence</h1>
  <div class="body">
    <p>Most advice aimed at men in this area is either a sales pitch for becoming someone
    else entirely, or a list of lines to memorise. Both treat confidence as a performance
    problem. It usually isn't.</p>

    <p>Confident Masculinity is about the ordinary, workable parts: how you come across
    before you've said anything, what to do with a silence, how to get out of your own way.
    Small things, mostly free, and the sort you only have to sort out once.</p>

    <p>We write for men who'd rather fix a few practical things than be told to reinvent
    themselves.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
